[38;5;252m[1m## Test suite[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mtests/common/mod.rs[0m [38;5;10mdlopen[0ms both libraries and resolves all 79 exports through a macro-generated table — no Rust function is ever called directly. Because [38;5;10mcargo test[0m doesn't build a [38;5;10mcdylib[0m, the harness shells out to [38;5;10mcargo build --lib[0m with a separate [38;5;10m--target-dir[0m (avoiding the outer build lock) and runs [38;5;10mcmake[0m if the C libs are missing, so plain [38;5;10mcargo test[0m works from a clean tree. Comparison is a deep field-by-field dump of every node plus a separate walk that checks the [38;5;10mprev[0m/[38;5;10mchild->prev[0m link invariants, plus byte comparison of both print modes.[0m[0m
